</reasoning>

<solution>
```python
def min_operations(s):
    n = len(s)
    dp = [0] * (n + 1)
    last_char = s[0]

    for i in range(1, n):
        if s[i] != last_char:
            dp[i + 1] = dp[i] + 1
            last_char = s[i]
        else:
            dp[i + 1] = dp[i]

    return dp[n]
```
