<solution>
```python
def count_distinct_cyclical_strings(n):
    dp = [[0] * n for _ in range(n + 1)]
    dp[0][0] = 1

    for k in range(1, n + 1):
        for i in range(k):
            dp[k][i] = dp[k - 1][i] + dp[k - 2][i - 1]
            dp[k][i] %= 10**9 + 7

    return dp[n][n - 1]
```
